Keep a shared first as empty text.
Place "anagram" into first.
Keep a shared second as empty text.
Place "nagaram" into second.
Keep a shared last as 0.
Set last to 6.
Keep a shared countfirst as 0.
Keep a shared countsecond as 0.
Keep a shared answer as 0.
Set answer to 1.
To tally from target (a whole number).
Set countfirst to 0.
Set countsecond to 0.
For every other from 0 to last.
The leftletter is character other of first.
The rightletter is character target of first.
The otherletter is character other of second.
If leftletter is rightletter, add 1 to countfirst.
If otherletter is rightletter, add 1 to countsecond.

For every spot from 0 to last.
Tally from spot.
If countfirst is not countsecond, set answer to 0.

If answer is 1, show true, otherwise show false.
